sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend (Settings)
    participant B as Backend
    participant C as CLI (claude / openai)
    participant P as Provider

    F->>B: GET /api/connections/{id}/oauth-start
    B->>B: resolve CLI binary (PATH / env override)
    alt CLI binary not found
        B-->>F: { available: false }
        Note over F: fall back to API key form
    else CLI available
        B->>C: spawn: claude login --print-login-url
        C-->>B: auth URL (first stdout line)
        B-->>F: { available: true, flow: "cli_browser", url, poll_url }
        F->>P: open popup to url
        Note over P: User grants permission
        P->>C: auth completion signal
        C->>C: write credentials to config dir
        loop every 2 s (max 5 min)
            F->>B: GET /api/connections/{id}/cli-login-status
            B->>C: claude whoami / openai whoami
            C-->>B: exit 0 + username
            B-->>F: { status: "connected", username }
        end
        F->>F: close popup; refresh connection card
    end